REALFRONTIER 0.9
id rank-increasing-escape
claim_scope C
query q0 BASE
query q1 EXTENSION
generator g0 THEORY A0
generator g1 EXTERNAL_CASE A1
rival r0 BASELINE g0
rival r1 BASELINE g0
rival r2 DISCOVERED g1
admit r0 PASS
admit r1 PASS
admit r2 PASS
distinguish q0 r0 r1
alias q0 r2 r0
alias q0 r2 r1
distinguish q1 r2 r1
root w0 EXTERNAL LIVE
root w1 EXTERNAL LIVE
obligation o0 BASELINE
obligation o1 DISCOVERED
separates w0 o0
separates w1 o1
search g0 12 NO_NEW
search g1 1 NEW
grammar OPEN
authorize_escape YES
authorize_off_query_escape YES
authorize_common_mode NO
authorize_saturation_mirage YES
authorize_rank_before 1
authorize_rank_after 2
END
